I raise one point of scope directly, because it bears on the result. The re=
quest covers records in which I am *named or identifiably described.* A sea=
rch keyed only to my name would not capture a record that describes me with=
out naming me. Given that a portion
 of this request concerns exactly such records, I ask DAS to confirm whethe=
r the search accounted for identifiable description and not only my name.</=
div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
